---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-cyber-border/80 bg-cyber-bg/90 mt-24 py-12">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Column 1: Info -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-cyber-surface2 border border-cyber-border flex items-center justify-center text-cyber-cyan">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold">&gt;_</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-heading font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
            Huaian<span class="text-cyber-cyan">.dev</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-cyber-muted max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          谢怀安的个人数字空间。专注于多智能体协作（Agentic Workflows）、全栈高并发系统构建与 AI 创新应用。
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-cyber-cyan">
          <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyber-green animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>STATUS: ONLINE · xiehuaian.de5.net</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Navigation -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-white uppercase">// 快速导航</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-cyber-muted">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">首页 (Home)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/portfolio" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">作品集 (Portfolio)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">技术博客 (Blog)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">关于我 (About)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">联系方式 (Contact)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Feed & Meta -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-white uppercase">// 资源与订阅</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-cyber-muted">
          <li>
            <a href="/rss.xml" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>RSS 订阅源</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">Sitemap 站点地图</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/xiehuaian77-sketch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">GitHub @xiehuaian77-sketch</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-cyber-border/40 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-cyber-muted">
      <div>
        © {currentYear} Xie Huaian (谢怀安). All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Powered by</span>
        <span class="text-cyber-cyan">Astro 5</span>
        <span>&</span>
        <span class="text-cyber-purple">Tailwind CSS</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
